### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@mID = MEM-2026-002

### 1. Create a New Member
# @name createMember
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "memberID": "{{mID}}",
    "fullname": "Juan Dela Cruz",
    "contactNo": "09123456789",
    "joinDate": "2026-03-12",
    "status": "active"
}

###

### 2. Get All Members
GET {{baseUrl}}/members
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get Member by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/{{mID}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update Member (Set to Inactive)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/{{mID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "inactive",
    "contactNo": "09998887766"
}

###

### 5. Test Validation: Duplicate ID (Should fail with 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "memberID": "{{mID}}",
    "fullname": "Duplicate User",
    "contactNo": "0000000000"
}

###

### 6. Delete Member
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/members/{{mID}}